{
  "$defs": {
    "GitCodeRevision": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "一份代码的 Git 身份：commit 与 tree 两个对象 ID（ADR-0015 §D-21.2）。\n\nADR-0005 §3 把生产代码身份定义为\"commit + tree hash\"的复合概念，因此它不是一个\n字符串槽位：单独的 commit 说明\"哪次提交\"，tree 说明\"实际内容是什么\"，\n两者分开才能区分\"同一 commit 的不同工作区内容\"。\n\n因为是值对象，相等性比较是**结构化**比较：两处生产代码身份是否一致，比较的是\n`(commit_oid, tree_oid)` 这一对，而不是可能只改了一半的字符串。\n\n**诚实边界**：只约束格式。commit / tree 是否真的存在于某个仓库、工作区是否干净、\ntree 是否真的属于该 commit，都需要访问 Git，属 Runner 与打包器（ADR-0015 运行时延期义务）。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.5.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "commit_oid": {
          "pattern": "^(?:[0-9a-f]{40}|[0-9a-f]{64})$",
          "title": "Commit Oid",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "tree_oid": {
          "pattern": "^(?:[0-9a-f]{40}|[0-9a-f]{64})$",
          "title": "Tree Oid",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "commit_oid",
        "tree_oid"
      ],
      "title": "GitCodeRevision",
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "生产实现与 golden outputs 的一致性检查（ADR-0005 §5）。\n\n`artifact_id` 是 Artifact manifest 规范化 JSON 的 SHA-256（ADR-0005 §3），\n因此它是 `ContentHash` 而不是不透明 ID（ADR-0015 §D-21.1）。\n`production_code_hash` 沿用既有线字段名，值已是结构化的 `GitCodeRevision`\n（commit + tree），不再是单个字符串（ADR-0015 §D-21.2）。",
  "properties": {
    "schema_version": {
      "default": "2.5.0",
      "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
      "title": "Schema Version",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "artifact_id": {
      "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
      "title": "Artifact Id",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "production_code_hash": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/GitCodeRevision"
    },
    "signals_match": {
      "title": "Signals Match",
      "type": "boolean"
    },
    "positions_match": {
      "title": "Positions Match",
      "type": "boolean"
    },
    "tolerance": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Tolerance"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "artifact_id",
    "production_code_hash",
    "signals_match",
    "positions_match"
  ],
  "title": "EquivalenceCheck",
  "type": "object"
}
